  "topic": "navigation",
  "subtopic": "implicit_targets",
  "title": "Implicit conversion operators",
  "summary": "A condition or `!` navigates to the conversion operator it runs",
  "prose": "Go-to-definition on the parenthesis of a condition (the `while` of a\n`do`), or on the `!`, `&&`, `||` or `?` whose operand converts, reaches the\nuser-defined conversion operator that tests the operand.",
  "status": "supported",
