      "text": "struct Guard {\n    explicit operator bool() const;\n};\n\nvoid use(Guard g) {\n    if (g) {}\n    for (; g;) {}\n    do {} while (g);\n    bool ok = !g;\n    bool both = g && ok;\n    bool either = ok || g;\n    int pick = g ? 1 : 0;\n}\n",
